  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiwemba Maize Marketing Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: maize and beans.Beneficiaries: 2,381 smallholder farmers (1,286 female and 1,095 male).Summary: The project will build KFCS technical skills especially in bulking and collective marketing, provide working capital for purchase of farm inputs and farmers produce. In addition the project will provide storage infrastructure to enhance to cooperatives capacity bulk and attract big buyers.</narrative>
  </description>
